From fe150292cb0904ae7c96b50a66612ca88cba2e08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matias Alvarez <alvarezjosematias1@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:13:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] docs: fix docstrings so the Sphinx build has no warnings

- Add missing docstrings (estimate_gender_onnx, inferenceSesion,
  threaded_videocap_read) and document estimate_age_onnx's return value.
- Fix parameter names that did not match the signature (draw_faces,
  jpg_ghosts, height_parallel_planes).
- Fix reST formatting errors in faces.align, measures and utils.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Mz3p7Zh2aCyeTMP13T2zSu
